<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Night Globe</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Conjurer (guild level 18), Sorcerer (guild level 25)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast night globe</a>
</pre>
<p>Creates an orb of darkness that sucks the light out of the place around it: 
it darkens as much as two sun globes light up. Use it to hide in the dark, or 
to take the light from those who rely on it.
</p><p>After five minutes the orb winks out of existence, and the light returns. You 
must be standing. The spell is also found on staffs, scrolls and wands. For 
light instead, see <a cmd='#'>Help Sun Globe</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sun Globe</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Darkness</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>